OL,3,GNEWSASchool to be knocked down for
OL,4,Ahousing development
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former school which has been closed
OL,7,Ffor years is due to be knocked down to
OL,8,Fmake way for homes.
OL,10,FSt Mary's Church of England Middle
OL,11,FSchool in Belford, Northumberland shut
OL,12,Fin 2018 and will be replaced by 23
OL,13,Fhomes.
OL,15,FDeveloper Garry Herron said he was
OL,16,Fcommitted to retaining the 45 memorial
OL,17,Ftrees planted on the site, as he
OL,18,Funderstood they had "a real importance
OL,19,Fto former pupils, staff and families".
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
