OL,3,GNEWSASchool to be knocked down for
OL,4,Ahousing development
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthumberland County Council's North
OL,7,Farea planning committee unanimously
OL,8,Fapproved the scheme at a meeting on
OL,9,FThursday.
